   "originalText": "AttackExecutionService 攻击编排（唯一正式入口）\nPlan → Cast → Group → RuntimeStep\nTargetingProtocol(交互确认) → RangedProtocol(Aim/Prepare/Fire/ProjectileInit)\n双武器: DualSourceLane 双侧独立协议 + 外层合并",
